      "detailed_description": "<h1>关注我们</h1><p>欢迎关注我们了解《那年夏末》的最新进展<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>B站:<br></li><li>官方玩家交流群：521308916</li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>《那年夏末》是一款以选择为核心玩法的互动视觉游戏，讲述了一个关于遗憾与成长的故事。职场失意的孙浩回到成长的地方，过往的人和事不断把他带回17岁的夏天。回忆中枯燥的校园生活及对未来的困惑让他产生了迷茫，直到那个插班生的出现,让他的生活起了变化...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583030/extras/1fbf8869d3f326ed6dfc0d40c19f99d8.avif?t=1749636552\" width=616 height=464 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583030/extras/66d1e532331c7793b62936e87eb25c57.avif?t=1749636552\" width=616 height=1112 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583030/extras/62e274f27339fb38dcb22360f375a130.avif?t=1749636552\" width=616 height=898 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583030/extras/8a5fc70102dedc8976761c431c1c2a34.avif?t=1749636552\" width=616 height=1230 /></span>",
      "about_the_game": "《那年夏末》是一款以选择为核心玩法的互动视觉游戏，讲述了一个关于遗憾与成长的故事。职场失意的孙浩回到成长的地方，过往的人和事不断把他带回17岁的夏天。回忆中枯燥的校园生活及对未来的困惑让他产生了迷茫，直到那个插班生的出现,让他的生活起了变化...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583030/extras/1fbf8869d3f326ed6dfc0d40c19f99d8.avif?t=1749636552\" width=616 height=464 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583030/extras/66d1e532331c7793b62936e87eb25c57.avif?t=1749636552\" width=616 height=1112 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583030/extras/62e274f27339fb38dcb22360f375a130.avif?t=1749636552\" width=616 height=898 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583030/extras/8a5fc70102dedc8976761c431c1c2a34.avif?t=1749636552\" width=616 height=1230 /></span>",
      "short_description": "这是一个关于遗憾与成长的故事。男生的思绪不断回到17岁的夏天，在一次次回忆与抉择中徘徊，是去尝试弥补遗憾？还是在释然间体会成长的意义?回忆中的她会在那等我吗？",
